{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/29028ada44bf3c5f3ac1ac350f35bb47.avif?t=1774820599\" width=609 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to cook and manage the kitchen\u2014<strong>unless you\u2019re the traitor, whose mission is to ruin everything!</strong> Fast-paced, hilarious, and full of sabotage. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/a626f925e9dd91e1bb86bfaf68a99d44.poster.avif?t=1774820599\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/a626f925e9dd91e1bb86bfaf68a99d44.webm?t=1774820599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/a626f925e9dd91e1bb86bfaf68a99d44.mp4?t=1774820599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traitor's Kitchen</strong> is a social deduction party game where chefs rush to deliver meals on time  while the traitor tries to ruin the deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/d5fe65030fc0dca0a75f5cd6c1556b25.poster.avif?t=1774820599\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/d5fe65030fc0dca0a75f5cd6c1556b25.webm?t=1774820599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/d5fe65030fc0dca0a75f5cd6c1556b25.mp4?t=1774820599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stop the traitor\u2019s sabotages:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electricity and gas can suddenly shut down, and the kitchen can instantly become a mess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/19cdf8e09c00b7330214b3ef73eba3a6.poster.avif?t=1774820599\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/19cdf8e09c00b7330214b3ef73eba3a6.webm?t=1774820599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/19cdf8e09c00b7330214b3ef73eba3a6.mp4?t=1774820599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take out the trash and keep the kitchen clean:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working in the kitchen isn\u2019t just about cooking. You also need to care about cleanliness and regularly take out the garbage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/267b9cf3e9f3e355199dd1301a9ea278.poster.avif?t=1774820599\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/